+### Responsive navigation tests
+
+Run the Playwright suite with Node.js 20 or later:
+
+```sh
+npm ci
+npx playwright install chromium firefox webkit
+npm run test:nav
+```
+
+On Linux, use `npx playwright install --with-deps` to install any missing browser system dependencies. To run one engine, use `npm run test:nav -- --project=chromium` (or `firefox` or `webkit`). The suite builds and serves the site locally on port 4173 and uses fixture data for the Airtable-backed requests.
